{"id": "DetgnCTyhR3", "title": "Video by devanshu.motion", "description": "Part 2/2 of Ravana x Mahadev Katha\nRavana lifted Kailash. Mahadev pressed it down with one toe, playfully, and the scream that came out of Dashagriv shook all three worlds. That scream is where the name Ravana comes from, and Mahadev gave it to him himself 🔱\n\nAnd the monkey Ravana laughed at? Years later he burned Lanka. The Shiva Purana says that was Shambhu himself, as Hanuman ji.\n\nTold as Ravanachhaya, Odisha's leather shadow theatre named after Ravana. Sources: Valmiki Ramayana, Uttara Kanda 7.16 and Sundara Kanda 5.50, Shiva Purana, Shatarudra Samhita 20.\n\nNext katha: the boon that let Ravana's son capture Indra 👀\n\nHappy Dussehra 🙏\n\n#dussehra #ravana #mahadev #hanumanji #ravanachhaya", "channel": "devanshu.motion", "uploader_id": "25176808901", "uploader": "Devanshu Singhai", "timestamp": 1792488816, "like_count": 1423, "comment_count": 13, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1674060570818364a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 56.337, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMbNDNYqS6jLiEmaHyURBcgFVw9ZMTjKlbCLngLOVd72uWna3luWtq6cHUTLlZtNwF6N5fY38GSt8aWt0bpChVpcOyvkZMqITZ-KCc.mp4?_nc_cat=106&_nc_oc=AdqFgBCUCHVGn-deOHngl1TEXgBNR2rKeBZHAj1KgT3wKvJMCdMBlkMoS0OqcJH-oZkA-4QN-Af80wyL9KrAU7xO&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=FdG-PnPT4lkQ7kNvwGoTtFd&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=3YSWGwUnn39E-HUDybIFbQ&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQSjAUxgNGrimlCRlRgzJacCeebvB-Z4Uf9I31buegJ9aQ&oe=6AF4459F", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 56.337, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) 